    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against your friends in this 3 - 8 player &quot;Selling Game&quot; where you turn any product into marketing masterpiece! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players get to <strong>choose the product</strong>. Whether it\u2019s a chocolate bar, a fizzy drink, or even a flying boat - unleash your creativity! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw</strong> your product, <strong>name it</strong>, and create a <strong>slogan</strong> so convincing that it earns you votes from all other players. More <strong>votes</strong> = more <strong>cash</strong> for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also earn money by <strong>voting wisely</strong> and <strong>investing in other players\u2019 ideas</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your vision, have fun and wipe the floor with your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 to 8 players</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fully Customizable Game Config</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set Draw/Name/Slogan/Vote time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn Investing on/off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set Investing Coefficient</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to come</p></li></ul>",
